.TH UNIM-TYPING-PRACTICE 1 "July 2026" "UNIM 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
unim\-typing\-practice \- typing practice with WPM, accuracy and heatmap
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B unim\-typing\-practice
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBunim\-typing\-practice\fR is a GTK4 + libadwaita tool for the UNIM
(Universal Next\-generation Input Method) engine. It runs a
typing\-practice session on the currently selected UNIM Hangul keymap.
.PP
It captures raw ASCII keys (bypassing any active system IME), feeds them
through the keymap's composer, and reports live WPM, CPM, accuracy and
error rate. After each session the per\-key error heatmap is painted on
top of the keyboard.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unim (1),
.BR unim\-keymap\-studio (1),
.BR unim\-settings (1)
